{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Yep. Looks perfect on you.": "",
  "Doesn't it!? I'm impressed... You really have good taste. ❤": "",
  "Sana-chan, I got you a present. Take it.": "",
  "Seriously!? You got me something <font_kind=yakuza_italic>this</font_kind> expensive...?": "",
  "Well, yeah...": "",
  "Oh... I just can't! It's not like I don't like it or anything, but... You didn't have to spend that much.": "",
  "Don't say that. I bought it with you specifically in mind.": "",
  "Really? Now I feel a little guilty...": "",
  "(Damn, I scared her off. Maybe she felt like I was overcompensating?)": "",
  "...Oh! Uh, thanks!": "",
  "Do you... like it?": "",
  "Well... I'm happy you were thinking of me!": "",
  "It doesn't really fit your style, does it...": "",
  "To be honest... it's a little too flashy for me. But that doesn't mean it's bad!": "",
  "Hmm. I thought it would look good on you.": "",
  "Then I'll have to try it out next time. Maybe.": "",
  "(I guess it was too flashy, according to her.)": "",
  "Wow, really? Thank you so much!": "",
  "(She seems to be pretty happy with it.)": "",
  "(Nah, not today.)": "",
  "Where should we go, Takayuki-san?": "",
  "(Hmm... What would be fun for today?)": "",
  "How about the batting center?": "",
  "Cool, then let's get going.": "",
  "How about some darts?": "",
  "Sure! You ready to meet your match?": "",
  "Hah, I think she's standing right here in front of me.": "",
  "Great, then let's get going.": "",
  "Thanks for coming out with me, Takayuki-san. I had a really great time!": "",
  "My pleasure. Same here.": "",
  "Well, I'll be seeing you later then. Call me anytime!": "",
  "(Thanks, Sana-chan. Whenever I go out with you, it's like I can finally clear my head.)": "",
  "Ready to send 'em flying, Takayuki-san?": "",
  "That's amazing! You're always so cool, Takayuki-san!": "",
  "Heh, it was nothing.": "",
  "I guess you did okay. Kind of.": "",
  "Nah, that was terrible. I can do much better.": "",
  "Are you tired or something?": "",
  "Oh, no... I guess I'm just feeling a little off today.": "",
  "Gotcha. Well I'm sure you'll do great next time!": "",
  "Yes! And I won't lose, either!": "",
  "Aww... You totally destroyed me... You're way too strong, Takayuki-san!": "",
  "Yay! I was able to hold my own for once!": "",
  "Definitely. You've gotten really good, Sana-chan.": "",
  "Thanks! It's all to impress you, of course!": "",
  "That... did not go as planned.": "",
  "Don't worry, Takayuki-san. I'll let you have a rematch anytime you want.": "",
  "(...Next time I'll win for sure!)": "",
  "Takayuki-san, I really want that plushie.": "",
  "Heh, I've gotten a lot better. Here you go, Sana-chan.": "",
  "All right, I got the thing. The plush. Whatever.": "",
  "But, this isn't the one I wanted...": "",
  "Ooh. Sorry.": "",
  "No no, I still like it! Thank you!": "",
  "(What should I give her?)": "",
  "What? Really!?": "",
  "That's really sweet of you, Takayuki-san...": "",
  "I'll treasure it forever!": "",
  "Sana-chan, I got you a present. Please, take it.": "",
  "Seriously!? You got me something <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> expensive?": "",
  "Oh... I just can't! It's not like I don't like it or anything, but... you didn't have to spend that much.": "",
  "(Maybe she felt like I was overcompensating for something?)": "",
  "O-Oh... Wow... Uh, thanks!": "",
  "Do you like it?": "",
  "Well, I'm... happy you were thinking of me!": "",
  "To be honest... it is a little flashy. But that doesn't mean it's bad!": "",
  "Hmm. I thought it'd look good on you.": "",
  "Then I'll have to try it out sometime.": "",
  "(I knew it was a little bit over the top...)": "",
  "So, I actually have something for you.": "",
  "...You can be so thick in the head sometimes, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Um, Yagami-san. I have something for you.": "",
  "What's this? A record?": "",
  "Yes. This was made by the president of my agency to commemorate my first album.": "",
  "Wow, that's pretty elaborate. I'll make sure to listen to this back at the office.": "",
  "Hehe. Hope you like it.": "",
  "(Now, what should we talk about today...)": "",
  "(That's all we have time for today.)": "",
  "...Takayuki-san. Hehe, that's gonna take some getting used to.": "",
  "It'll come naturally as we spend more time together.": "",
  "Then I'll be looking forward to that... Takayuki-san.": "",
  "So will I, Sana-chan.": "",
  "...Guess I'll see you soon?": "",
  "Look, if you really consider yourself her fan, then what you're doing right now makes no sense whatsoever.": "",
  "Oh, and I live nearby, so I don't have to worry about missing the last train.": "",
  "Nice, Sana-chan! That jacket looks great on you!": "",
  "Hehe, you think so?": "",
  "I didn't have any outfits like this so I wasn't sure how it would go, but I'm glad it looks good!": "",
  "U-Um, so about the thing I wanted to talk about...": "",
  "Oh yeah, you mentioned something about a confession you had to make.": "",
  "Hey, that looks great on you.": "",
  "You think so? It's a little embarrassing... But thank you!": "",
  "I actually have a present for you.": "",
  "Wow! A racing jacket!? Oh, but...": "",
  "Hm? You don't like it?": "",
  "Oh, no, I'm overjoyed! It's just...": "",
  "If I wear this with you, wouldn't we kinda match?": "",
  "Oh, good point. I hadn't thought of that.": "",
  "So you don't mind, then!? We'll look so cute! I'll wear it next time!": "",
  "(Is matching cute? Well, as long as she's happy.)": "",
  "We'd look like a real couple! It'd be cute to wear this on a date, wouldn't it?": "",
  "Y-Yeah... Matching outfits are... cute, I guess.": "",
  "(A change of scenery might be nice.)": "",
  "(Nice! I'm liking that.)": "",
  "(Eh, nothing I have is really speaking to me...)": "",
  "Well, if it ain't a fresh new face! Howdy! The name's Koro-nyan, an' I run this dang ol' Dice & Cube game!": "",
  "I was born n' raised in Hiroshima, y'see. Back home I always dreamed of bein' a big-time mascot, and well—here I am!": "",
  "'Fraid ya only get one roll at the moment...": "",
  "If ya can't get to a Dice Plus space or reach the goal within that roll...": "",
  "It'll be game over. So better hope n' pray that Lady Luck be with ya whenever them dice get to rollin'!": "",
  "Now then. Notice that the number atop the dice went down by 1?": "",
  "That number shows how many dice ya throw during this crazy ol' game. An' when it reaches 0...": "",
  "Bang! Boom! Kablow! It's game over, sonny! So mind that dice number whenever ya make yer moves.": "",
  "Oh! But the higher yer number is here, the higher the bonus you get!": "",
  "The bonus changes depending on how much ya have left. Just press <symbol=button_shikaku> to lookit the details!": "",
  "Let's keep on goin', sonny boy!": "",
  "Nice li'l trinket ya got there. These item doohickeys or whatever ya kids call 'em are exchanged fer cash at the end.": "",
  "By the way, you can check the details of yer items by pressing <symbol=button_sankaku>, so keep that in your noggin!": "",
  "A branching path, eh? Well, whichever way ya go is upta you...": "",
  "But whatever fate befalls ya is yer responsibility alone.": "",
  "...By the way, y'can check what's ahead by pressing <symbol=button_l1> and lookin' at the dang ol' map.": "",
  "The goal draws close! It's just a straight path to the goal now.": "",
  "Watch your footing and get yerself on over to the goal! Hop to it!": "",
  "\"Dice Plus\" increases yer dice by the number displayed on the space.": "",
  "It might be a good idea to try n' go for these spaces when yer startin' t'run outta dice!": "",
  "\"Dice Minus\" decreases yer dice by the number displayed on the space.": "",
  "Y'can get yer dice back by clearin' \"Battle Spaces\" or landin' on \"Dice Plus\" spaces!": "",
  "\"Gift Space\" gives ya items to exchange. Y'might even get somethin' rare n' shiny to boot!": "",
  "This's a space where only good things happen, so y'better thank yer lucky stars if ya land here!": "",
  "This here's a \"Battle Space.\" The more stars it's got, the rougher n' tougher the battles are!": "",
  "But if ya manage to win, the number of stars the space had will be added t'yer total dice. Not bad, eh?": "",
  "Okie-doke... Time to show this cockamamie vidya game what yer made of!": "",
  "Ya won't get yer reward unless ya win. Also, you'll be dragged back to the startin' point as a penalty!": "",
  "Better luck next time, sonny boy! Hope ya get somethin' good!": "",
  "S-Sonny boy... yer down to zero health! That means y'gotta start from the beginnin'!": "",
  "Don't worry, I'll get yer health bar back on track... jus' be more careful now, y'hear?": "",
  "If you fail, sonny...": "",
  "You'll get kicked back to the start, no doubt! Y'will get all yer health back, though.": "",
  "Ya don't have enough dice! Which means...": "",
  "The game's over... Fret not, I'm always here fer ya, so come back again anytime!": "",
  "This ain't just' any ol' Battle Space... it's a Destruction Battle Space, where y'can legally go on an insane rampage!": "",
  "Y'gotta break, smash, n' overturn everything in this here store within the given time limit!": "",
  "Yer gonna keep on failin' if ya can't wreck everythin' within the time limit...": "",
  "Put some elbow grease into it next time, eh?": "",
  "Ah, this's a Warp Space! If y'manage to land here, y'can warp to a different space on the board!": "",
  "This space here n' the one it warps to stay connected, so y'can go back n' forth as much as y'want! Use 'em wisely!": "",
  "This right here's a Drone Space, where you'll fight a vicious drone. Sure didn't have these back in my day...": "",
  "Anyway, all y'need to do is shoot down the enemy drones by usin' yer high-flyin', quick-dodgin' piloting skills!": "",
  "So ya got shot down, huh... Guess they were a lick too fast for ya.": "",
  "It happens! You'll jus' hafta start over, m'boy!": "",
  "When y'land on a Safe Space, you'll hafta open a locked safe usin' lock pickin' or even the good ol' thumb turn bypass.": "",
  "You'll get a mighty-fine item if y'can open the safe in time.": "",
  "Couldn't do it? Nice goin', butterfingers...": "",
  "Now whatever was inside is gone! Try not t'let the next chance slip through yer fingers, y'hear?": "",
  "Y'really cleared the entire course!? Say... that's one fer the record books, I'll tell ya that!": "",
  "We gotta celebrate with some sake! Hm? VR sake, o'course!": "",
  "Ah. The time has come. Y'see, when you roll 5 6 2...": "",
  "In other words, my favorite number... you'll immediately enter... Koro-nyan Mode!": "",
  "You're in luck, sonny! Let's give it a go!!!": "",
  "That sparkly golden fella over there... is actually an incarnation of the great King Koro-nyan!": "",
  "If y'defeat him, an extra King Koro-nyan will appear on the map!": "",
  "Now go get 'em... an' receive the great King Koro-nyan's blessing!": "",
  "A job well done, m'boy! Now, somewhere in the city...": "",
  "Sure is nice to have some company in this doggone virtual prison o'mine, heh heh! Now lemme learn ya the rules!": "",
  "There're 3 basic things y'oughta know 'bout Dice & Cube:": "",
  "First, y'can start rollin' them there dice with <symbol=button_decide> and stop 'em with <symbol=button_decide>.": "",
  "Second, there's a limit to how many dice y'can roll per game.": "",
  "And third. Items ya find 'round these parts are converted 'ta cash rewards once all's said n' done.": "",
  "This third rule's mighty important... but I reckon it's quicker to show ya than just runnin' off at the mouth!": "",
  "Time fer yer first roll! Don't be nervous now, sonny. Loosen up them shoulders an' relax them cheeks!": "",
  "There should be another King Koro-nyan! Check on yer map by pressing <symbol=button_l1>!": "",
  "Couldn't get the gold guy, huh... Well, I'm sure you'll see him again sometime!": "",
  "Don't worry about it. Jus' keep doin' yer thing!": "",
  "Th-That purple fella...! That's Kuro-nyan's evil incarnation!": "",
  "If you don't defeat him, his evil presence'll manifest somewhere in the city...": "",
  "Which means another Kuro-nyan will appear! So y'cant afford to lose, sonny boy!": "",
  "You did it, sonny! Now you won't have to worry about that gosh dern Kuro-nyan...": "",
  "For a while, anyway. Y'never know when that dang ol' cat's gonna show up again, so y'best mind yer step.": "",
  "Doggone it... there's another Kuro-nyan on the map!": "",
  "Kuro-nyan likes to give chase, so be careful not to bump into him!": "",
  "Yowza! My whiskers're tinglin' all of a sudden! Kuro-nyan might be nearby...": "",
  "If ya bump inta that mischievous li'l creature, he'll be sure t'cause ya some trouble...": "",
  "So make sure to avoid him at all costs! Understand, sonny!?": "",
  "Such a noble n' kingly presence in the air... I reckon King Koro-nyan's nearby!": "",
  "Check on the map n' find him, sonny boy!": "",
  "Deary me... if it ain't the magnificent King Koro-nyan himself! Never thought I'd live t'see the day!": "",
  "Y'see, King Koro-nyan's a good and benevolent ruler that governs over virtual Kamurocho!": "",
  "Something good is bound t'happen if ya meet him!": "",
  "That's why ya should chase after him whenever you see him!": "",
  "No... it can't be... say it ain't so! Unless my eyes deceive me, and deceive me they often do... that's Kuro-nyan!!!": "",
  "He's a trickster who gets his kicks by chasin' folks around and causin' general mischief n' mayhem!": "",
  "Somethin' bad'll definitely happen if you run into him, so be careful, m'boy!": "",
  "So, y'met King Koro-nyan? Well, that's fine n' dan— Ehh!? What's happenin' to me...?": "",
  "I feel... alive again! There's power coursin' through these ol' bones o' mine... This can only mean one thing:": "",
  "It's Koro-nyan Moooooooode!!!": "",
  "Y'could say I'm a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cat</font_kind>alyst for all this <font_kind=yakuza_italic>meow</font_kind>erful energy...\nIn other words... it's bonus time!": "",
  "Every space'll turn into a Bonus Challenge! That's a lotta opportunities to gain some good stuff!": "",
  "It stops once you have moved 3 times, do your best!": "",
  "All right, let's make it rain, sonny!": "",
  "Bonus Challenge time! Get ready for a Knockout Battle! All y'gotta do is beat the tar outta these enemies I prepared!": "",
  "You'll get an additional bonus based on how many attacks ya landed, so sock 'em to yer heart's content!": "",
  "This Bonus Challenge right here's a Destruction Battle!\nIn other words, break everythin' in sight!": "",
  "The more stuff ya break, the better yer rewards'll be!\nSo get in there n' do some damage!": "",
  "Atta boy! Ya punched yer way into gettin' an additional bonus!": "",
  "Accept it graciously!": "",
  "Erm. Sonny. Y'do hafta hit these folks at least once to get the bonus, y'hear?": "",
  "Punch the livin' daylights outta it next time and make tons of dough!": "",
  "Ooooh, now you gone an' done it! Y'bumped into Kuro-nyan!\n...I gotta bad feelin' about this...": "",
  "*hissss* Wh-What's he doin'...!?": "",
  "Noooooo...! That scoundrel! He went n' took all yer precious items!": "",
  "Still, he must be somewhere in the city! You gotta catch up t'him and get those items back...": "",
  "While we're at it, let's take all them other items he's been stockin' up and teach him a real good lesson!!!": "",
  "Aha! I sense Kuro-nyan lurkin' nearby! Looks like he's meanin' ta scamper away from ya!": "",
  "Find that little whippersnapper on the map, then go clobber him!": "",
  "Gotcha, ya little thief! Now hand over the items... Eh!? He's callin' in reinforcements!": "",
  "Doesn't matter! You jus' show him who's boss!": "",
  "Y'did it, sonny!": "",
  "Y'got all yer items back and then some!": "",
  "Maybe dependin' on how you approach him, even a whelp like Kuro-nyan can be useful!": "",
  "Now let's get on over to the goal, sonny!": "",
  "In order t'become a sweeter mascot, I reckon I oughta learn more about sweets! Such as? Uh... marinated seaweed?": "",
  "My ol' lady, she says drinkin' sweet potato shochu ain't cute! So I changed m'regular snack to fermented soybeans!": "",
  "Hurgh... this pungent odor... smells like the pharmacy back in Hiroshima. Gee, I wonder how the ol' gang is doin'...": "",
  "Y'got yerself a nice lady to come home to? C'mon, y'can tell yer ol' pal Koro-nyan... Bet I could cheer ya right up!": "",
  "If I were t'become a national mascot sensation... y'think I'd do better in movies!? Or bein' a newscaster!?": "",
  "Don't worry if ya screw up every now n' then. It's jus' a game! Ya won't lose a pinky over it or nothin'.": "",
  "A mascot's gotta be cute n'furry, right!? Well, all I need t'do is find some fur... Huh? Yer sayin' I got it backwards?": "",
  "My pa, he's a programmer. From Hiroshima, too. Heard he's makin' some sorta zombie shootin' game in Kamurocho now.": "",
  "Hey. Y'got the eyes of a man who's seen his share of scuffles... Reminds me of my oath brothers back home...": "",
  "Dude, so I decided to nerf my dialect in the dialogue settings, and— Y'don't hafta look so happy, y'know!": "",
  "I got a hankerin' for one o'them whatchamacallits... crepes! Once I escape this virtual prison, I'm gonna chow down!": "",
  "The famous Ono Michio... folks love that big, orange-headed fella, don't they? I s'pose he's a worthy rival fer me.": "",
  "Heard they have stuffed versions of me in the outside world. Didja know that, sonny boy?": "",
  "Ain't I the most adorable goddamn mascot y'ever seen!? I been askin' around, but folks seem too scared t'answer...": "",
  "Nice t'see ya back, sonny! Make a lot of money n' drink some damn good booze!": "",
  "Y'came back, eh? Well, go on, show 'em whatcha got!": "",
  "Virtual Kamurocho's open 365 days a year... So rake in a big load o'cash n' buy yer good friend Koro-nyan a drink!": "",
  "Well, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>somebody's</font_kind> lookin' like a handsome specimen of a man! ...That's enough flattery for today, so let's get started.": "",
  "Hewwo, I'm Koro-nyan! *purrr* Nice to meetcha! *mrowww*\n...Gawd, that was hideous.": "",
  "I only go over-the-top like this because I want ya t'be happy. Sorry if it's a bit much.": "",
  "Back in Hiroshima, my pa worked his darndest to make me into a mascot everyone would love.": "",
  "Wonder if I should put on some cat ears to show off m'cuteness... Wait, I have 'em on already!?": "",
  "Cyberspace is my personal territory. I'm the judge, jury, n' executioner here, so don't worry 'bout no gahtdang cops.": "",
  "I went n' bought me a ribbon to accent my cuter features, but I can't put it on cause o' my fiber allergies... *sniff*": "",
  "My dream in this virtual life o'mine? To make my pa proud of callin' me \"son\"... by becomin' a well-loved mascot!": "",
  "...I wanna be cute, I really do, but my favorite food is squid. Don't tell nobody, got it?": "",
  "Nice town, ain't it? I heard it's modeled exactly after the real Kamurocho, right down to the grime caked into the road!": "",
  "This is highly confidential, but... if y'add up all the numbers on my sides, the total's 21.": "",
  "Heard y'can win a prize worth more n' 50,000 yen if y'get good at this dang ol' game!": "",
  "There's some real dern good stuff locked up in them Safe Spaces... such as premium-grade canned cat food!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Well, yeah...": "ก็... ใช่นะ...",
  "Heh, it was nothing.": "ฮึ ไม่มีอะไรหรอก",
  "Are you tired or something?": "เหนื่อยรึเปล่า?",
  "Hehe, you think so?": "เฮ่อ ๆ คิดงั้นเหรอ?"
 }
}
